{"key":"theme/1800s","entities":[{"id":"theme.opera","type":"theme","labels":{"zh-Hans":"戏台与曲艺：从徽班到豫剧","en":"Stage and Song: Peking Opera and Local Theatre"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1800","end":"1949","precision":"year"},"order":"chronological","question":{"zh-Hans":"从徽班进京到豫剧、评剧、越剧成形，戏台上的行当、流派与名角是怎么来的？"},"summary":{"zh-Hans":"这一条线按「京昆—豫剧—评剧—越剧黄梅粤剧—曲艺」五段排：程长庚、余三胜、张二奎把徽汉合流唱成京剧，汪桂芬、孙菊仙、杨月楼接成「后三杰」，同光十三绝把行当定下来；豫剧从陈素真、常香玉到《朝阳沟》的三团，是地方戏里最完整的一条现代化路径；评剧从白玉霜到新凤霞、小白玉霜，越剧有袁雪芬的改革，黄梅戏有严凤英，粤剧有红线女；最后是侯宝林、马三立、骆玉笙、高元钧、李润杰——相声、京韵大鼓、山东快书、快板书。"},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.程长庚"},{"ref":"source.wiki.常香玉"}],"sections":[{"title":{"zh-Hans":"京剧：前三杰与同光名伶"},"intro":{"zh-Hans":"京剧是徽班进京之后唱出来的：程长庚主持三庆班，把徽调、汉调、昆曲揉在一起；余三胜带汉调入班，张二奎以「奎派」嗓音响彻京城，三人并称「前三杰」。此后汪桂芬、孙菊仙与谭鑫培接成「后三杰」；杨月楼兼擅老生武生，王楞仙、陈德霖、龚云甫、时小福、金秀山、罗寿山各占小生、青衣、老旦、花脸、文丑一行——「同光十三绝」把这一代人的行当定了下来。"},"members":["person.cheng-changgeng","person.yu-sansheng","person.zhang-erkui","person.wang-guifen","person.sun-juxian","person.yang-yuelou","person.wang-lengxian","person.chen-delinn","person.gong-yunfu","person.shi-xiaofu","person.tian-jiyun","person.jin-xiushan","person.luo-shoushan"]},{"title":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧：名旦与三团"},"intro":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧在 20 世纪完成了从草台到剧院的转身：陈素真以女演员身份登台，被称为「豫剧皇后」；常香玉以《花木兰》成「常派」，抗战时义演捐机；崔兰田、马金凤、阎立品、桑振君并称五大名旦；唐喜成的假声、牛得草的丑角各成一路。另一边，河南豫剧院三团用《朝阳沟》把现代戏立住——王善朴、魏云、柳兰芳、高洁、王秀兰都是这条线上的人。"},"members":["person.chen-suzhen","person.cui-lantian","person.ma-jinfeng","person.yan-lipin","person.sang-zhenjun","person.tang-xicheng","person.niu-decao","person.wang-sujun","person.zhao-yiting","person.chang-xiangyu","person.zhang-xiuyun","person.zhang-xinfang","person.shen-fengmei","person.wei-yun","person.gao-jie","person.wang-xiulan","person.wang-shanpu","person.liu-lanfang"]},{"title":{"zh-Hans":"评剧"},"intro":{"zh-Hans":"评剧从莲花落与唐山落子长出来：白玉霜以《马寡妇开店》走红，养女小白玉霜承其衣钵；新凤霞创「新派」，一出《刘巧儿》唱遍全国；筱俊亭开老旦「筱派」，韩少云在沈阳评剧院自成一家。"},"members":["person.xin-fengxia","person.bai-yushuang","person.xiao-junting","person.han-shaoyun","person.xiao-baiyushuang"]},{"title":{"zh-Hans":"越剧、黄梅戏与粤剧"},"intro":{"zh-Hans":"南方三种戏各有一条路：越剧靠袁雪芬的「新越剧」改革从嵊县小歌班变成全国大剧种，她是「越剧十姐妹」之一；黄梅戏因严凤英的《天仙配》从安庆乡间唱到全国；粤剧有红线女的「红腔」，《昭君出塞》唱了几十年。"},"members":["person.yuan-xuefen","person.yan-fengying","person.hongxiannv"]},{"title":{"zh-Hans":"相声与曲艺"},"intro":{"zh-Hans":"曲艺是另一座戏台：侯宝林把相声从撂地搬进剧场，马三立的「马派」以文哏见长；骆玉笙的京韵大鼓「骆派」有「金嗓鼓王」之称；高元钧创「高派」山东快书，李润杰把快板书做成一个独立曲种。"},"members":["person.hou-baolin","person.ma-sanli","person.luo-yusheng","person.gao-yuanjun","person.li-runjie"]}],"members":["person.cheng-changgeng","person.yu-sansheng","person.zhang-erkui","person.wang-guifen","person.sun-juxian","person.yang-yuelou","person.wang-lengxian","person.chen-delinn","person.gong-yunfu","person.shi-xiaofu","person.tian-jiyun","person.jin-xiushan","person.luo-shoushan","person.chen-suzhen","person.cui-lantian","person.ma-jinfeng","person.yan-lipin","person.sang-zhenjun","person.tang-xicheng","person.niu-decao","person.wang-sujun","person.zhao-yiting","person.chang-xiangyu","person.zhang-xiuyun","person.zhang-xinfang","person.shen-fengmei","person.wei-yun","person.gao-jie","person.wang-xiulan","person.wang-shanpu","person.liu-lanfang","person.xin-fengxia","person.bai-yushuang","person.xiao-junting","person.han-shaoyun","person.xiao-baiyushuang","person.yuan-xuefen","person.yan-fengying","person.hongxiannv","person.hou-baolin","person.ma-sanli","person.luo-yusheng","person.gao-yuanjun","person.li-runjie"],"memberNote":{"person.cheng-changgeng":{"zh-Hans":"京剧前三杰之首，三庆班主"},"person.yu-sansheng":{"zh-Hans":"前三杰之一，汉调入京，余叔岩之祖"},"person.zhang-erkui":{"zh-Hans":"前三杰之一，「奎派」老生"},"person.wang-guifen":{"zh-Hans":"后三杰之一，汪派老生"},"person.sun-juxian":{"zh-Hans":"后三杰之一，艺名「老乡亲」"},"person.yang-yuelou":{"zh-Hans":"同光十三绝，杨小楼之父"},"person.wang-lengxian":{"zh-Hans":"同光十三绝，小生"},"person.chen-delinn":{"zh-Hans":"青衣「老夫子」，梅兰芳之师"},"person.gong-yunfu":{"zh-Hans":"老旦「龚派」"},"person.shi-xiaofu":{"zh-Hans":"同光十三绝，四喜班主"},"person.tian-jiyun":{"zh-Hans":"河北梆子「响九霄」"},"person.jin-xiushan":{"zh-Hans":"架子花脸「金派」，金少山之父"},"person.luo-shoushan":{"zh-Hans":"同光十三绝，文丑"},"person.chen-suzhen":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧皇后，「豫剧梅兰芳」"},"person.cui-lantian":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧五大名旦，崔派"},"person.ma-jinfeng":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧五大名旦，《穆桂英挂帅》"},"person.yan-lipin":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧五大名旦，闺门旦"},"person.sang-zhenjun":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧五大名旦，桑派"},"person.tang-xicheng":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧生角，「二本腔」唐派"},"person.niu-decao":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧丑角，《七品芝麻官》"},"person.wang-sujun":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧旦兼小生，「汴京三王」"},"person.zhao-yiting":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧生角，《南阳关》"},"person.chang-xiangyu":{"zh-Hans":"常派，《花木兰》，义演捐机"},"person.zhang-xiuyun":{"zh-Hans":"台湾豫剧皇太后"},"person.zhang-xinfang":{"zh-Hans":"河南曲剧皇后"},"person.shen-fengmei":{"zh-Hans":"越调名家，演诸葛亮"},"person.wei-yun":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧三团，《朝阳沟》"},"person.gao-jie":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧三团旦角"},"person.wang-xiulan":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧祥符调青衣，「汴京三王」"},"person.wang-shanpu":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧三团，《朝阳沟》"},"person.liu-lanfang":{"zh-Hans":"豫剧三团主演"},"person.xin-fengxia":{"zh-Hans":"评剧新派创始人，评剧皇后"},"person.bai-yushuang":{"zh-Hans":"评剧旦角，《马寡妇开店》"},"person.xiao-junting":{"zh-Hans":"评剧老旦「筱派」"},"person.han-shaoyun":{"zh-Hans":"沈阳评剧院演员"},"person.xiao-baiyushuang":{"zh-Hans":"白玉霜养女，评剧名角"},"person.yuan-xuefen":{"zh-Hans":"越剧改革者，「越剧十姐妹」"},"person.yan-fengying":{"zh-Hans":"黄梅戏《天仙配》"},"person.hongxiannv":{"zh-Hans":"粤剧「红腔」，《昭君出塞》"},"person.hou-baolin":{"zh-Hans":"相声第六代，文哏与柳活"},"person.ma-sanli":{"zh-Hans":"相声泰斗，「马派」"},"person.luo-yusheng":{"zh-Hans":"京韵大鼓「骆派」，金嗓鼓王"},"person.gao-yuanjun":{"zh-Hans":"山东快书「高派」创始人"},"person.li-runjie":{"zh-Hans":"快板书创立者"}}}]}